          "Why does spin-½ exist?",
          "SU(2) double-covers SO(3): π₁(SO(3)) = ℤ/2ℤ"
        ],
        [
          "What is a gauge field mathematically?",
          "Connection on a principal fiber bundle"
        ],
        [
          "What is the field strength Fμν?",
          "Curvature of the connection"
        ],
        [
          "What classifies topological insulators?",
          "Chern number (∈ ℤ), a topological invariant"
        ],
        [
